OL,3,GNEWSADrop in donations puts community
OL,4,Apantry at risk
OL,5,
OL,6,FVolunteers at a community pantry say
OL,7,Fthey fear they may have to close unless
OL,8,Fthey can bring in additional donations
OL,9,Fof money and food.
OL,11,FTina Sampson-Smith from St Paul's
OL,12,Fcommunity pantry, in Norton Lees,
OL,13,FSheffield, said a drop off in donations
OL,14,Fand a rise in demand had left them in a
OL,15,Fprecarious situation.
OL,17,FAsked how the coming weeks and months
OL,18,Flooked she replied: "They look pretty
OL,19,Fgrim at the moment."
