OL,3,GNEWSADrop in donations puts community
OL,4,Apantry at risk
OL,5,
OL,6,FAccording to the Trussell Trust more
OL,7,Fthan 2.2m food parcels were given out
OL,8,Fin England in 2025, a 56% rise on 2019.
